cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reuse this software, benchmark, or negative result, cite this repository and the exact commit."
type: software
title: "depverify: Dependency-aware verification for coding agents"
authors:
  - family-names: Legotin
    given-names: Artem
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/arlegotin/DAV"
url: "https://github.com/arlegotin/DAV"
abstract: >-
  A finite evidence-acquisition planner, masked replay harness, and bounded
  coding-agent verification experiment. Two separate pilots ended with
  INCONCLUSIVE and NO_GO results. Public tests were useful in the fresh pilot,
  while the proposed dependency-aware mechanism lacked acquisition headroom.
  No fitted or held-out mechanism advantage is claimed.
keywords:
  - verification
  - coding agents
  - evidence acquisition
  - correlated errors
  - reproducibility
